00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.090
and yellow

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.840
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:02.300
all varied colors

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.780
that they

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.930
shine so brightly!

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:11.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.770
with such care

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.490
will never wither

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.950
Now, all together

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.410
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.080
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:33.000
They're always right by our sides

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:33.830
So together

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:37.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.630
bloom even more!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.130
HeartCatch

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:43.640
Precure!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.540
Can we really go on like this?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.750
What are you saying?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.040
I believe she has been exposed to too much of the Precure's sacred light,

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.290
corroding the darkness within her.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:29.680
Farewell, Sasorina...

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:29.680
Farewell, Sasorina...

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.900
You're quitting as president of the student council?!

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.110
Yeah.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:39.510
My term comes to an end this month,

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:44.490
and I know I'm going to need to dedicate 
more time to fighting the Desert Apostles.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.880
Well, yeah, but...

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:50.660
I intend to not seek reelection so I can focus on being a Precure.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.400
Now hold on just a sec!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:58.020
Ever since you became president, Itsuki, 
the school's been a much nicer place to be!

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.170
And that's all thanks to you!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:01.840
Thank you for that.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.760
But my mind is made up.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:10.430
I think I'm going to suggest my current vice president, Satou, run for the post.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.690
