00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.360
I'll be able to take my pick!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.080
President!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.200
Satou,

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:17.490
I really hope that's not the actual 
reason you're running for president.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:20.120
No, um, I was just...

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.000
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:27.220
The role of president requires you work
 tirelessly for the benefit of <i>all</i> of our students.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.760
I-I'm so sorry!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.850
Professor Sabark,

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:48.710
I ask that you remove Sasorina from the line of duty, and take her to the Planet Fortress to recuperate!

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:55.790
I'm sure you're aware, Professor, but I fear she does not have the will left to partake in our struggle.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.460
Not so fast, you two!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.670
What are you saying here?! Do you really think I can't handle this?!

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:11.570
Professor Sabark, send me out there, please!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.010
I know I can defeat those damn Precure if I try!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:19.800
What?

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.770
You can't. Not like this.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.700
Don't you dare look down on me!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:38.290
Professor Sabark, please let me handle this! I beg you!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.320
Very well.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.140
You have my blessing.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:46.300
But I shall not accept any further failures.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.110
I don't intend to fail.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:52.380
I'll show you just how strong I can be!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.790
Sasorina.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.900
You'll need these.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:15.870
With three times the dark power, you 
might just be able to beat the Precure.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.230
But your body won't take the strain for long.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.870
You'll have to make it quick.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:27.240
Don't expect me to thank you.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:40.230
Oh god, why did she have to walk in then?!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.750
What do we have here?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.970
The Flower of your Heart is wilting quite nicely, boy.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:54.270
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.380
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.250
Student Council Office

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.590
I'll go check the classrooms!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.720
You two get out while you can!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.300
Itsuki!

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.100
President!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.420
Calm down, it's okay. Let's get out of here!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.150
Okay!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.570
Everybody leave the school grounds and meet up at the park!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.490
Ms. Tsurusaki!

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:33.810
Can you get her to safety for me?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:34.530
Myoudouin!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.620
Ow...

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.600
You okay?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.150
Oh, president!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.160
