00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:56.340
Yeah.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.560
Schoooooooooool!{Alkaid - You could probably draw out the 'Schoooooooool!' a bit more if you want.}

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.950
It's Satou!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.910
