00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.980
We have a school to protect!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.240
Right!

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:07.540
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.410
Precure!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.210
Open My Heart!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.790
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.900
Cure Blossom!

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.980
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.470
Cure Marine!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.940
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.650
Cure Sunshine!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:29.350
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.030
Cure Moonlight!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:40.120
Schoooool!

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.430
Precure Body Punch!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.850
There you are, Precure!

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.730
You again?!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:57.430
Hmph! Don't worry, you won't be around to see me again!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:02.730
This triple-powered Dark Bracelet will soon see to that!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.320
Be on your guard.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.870
