00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:16.970
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:21.090
Dark Bracelet!

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:26.350
It's time you saw what the Desert Apostles can really do!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.940
Unite!

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:41.860
This is the power of three Dark Bracelets!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.280
Enough to defeat you Precure for good!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:10.140
Double Body Punch!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.750
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:21.360
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:27.110
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:35.750
With all this power, I'm invincible!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.250
But that's not all I can do!

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:50.050
Look how much power three Dark Bracelets provide!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.190
She might just be able to do this.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:58.600
Hand over your transformation 
devices, or I'll stomp you all flat!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.820
Did you hear me?! Do it!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.990
No! We won't give up!

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.950
Sasorina, we're going to make you give Satou his heart back!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.140
You still want to fight me?!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:23.440
Who cares about the Flowers of their Hearts?! Who cares about you Precure?!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.920
It's all pathetic!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.770
Damn you, Precure!

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.780
Let's finish this.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:57.790
What?

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:11.670
Let's use the HeartCatch Mirage and put an end to her suffering!

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:23.000
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.430
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:59.310
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.870
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.780
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.270
I can't lose...

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:50.980
Not like this... I'm a commander of the Desert Apostles!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.040
We have to stop them!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.350
This fight is beyond her now.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.750
It's better this way.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.710
You're sounding as bad as me.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:50.880
Sasorina, you did yourself proud.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.630
Kumojacky...

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:06.660
Kobraja...

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:09.600
Thank you.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.080
A dogtooth violet.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:56.070
In the language of flowers, it means both
 "to suffer through sadness" and "jealousy."

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.180
You shall be made to pay for this!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:09.040
We were wrong to treat you so lightly.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.540
Next time we meet, your ends are certain!

